      "writtenOn": "2024-11-21T22:52:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Each property adds maintenance burden and a possibility for creating a failure if it\u0027s not set properly, so it\u0027s better to avoid introducing them without a clear need. In this case, I don\u0027t see why the symbol name has to be allowed to vary from vendor to vendor. Do you have a strong case for that?",
